{
  "question": "How often must a certified SDVOSB recertify with SBA?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "Under federal rules, a certified SDVOSB must recertify its eligibility with the SBA every 3 years. Participants may submit their recertification within 90 calendar days before the end of their eligibility period, and if they miss that window, SBA will reinstate them if they recertify within 30 days after the eligibility period ends.",
